      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(It’s that family of three I saw earlier...)",
        "zh": "（是之前见过的一家三口...）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(They seem to be locals returning from a trip. They probably know a bit about what’s going on in Yuntai. I could use this opportunity to ask about the city.)",
        "zh": "（他们似乎是旅游回来的本地居民，对芸台市的近况较为了解。 我可以趁机打听一些当地的事。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": -1,
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
            "en": "About this \"<color=orange>Troupe Elysium</color>\"...",
            "zh": "关于这个“<color=orange>极乐戏团</color>”...",
            "ja": ""
          },
          "targetIndex": 12,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
              "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
              "variableName": "infoPassA_1",
              "comparison": "Equal",
              "compareValue": "False"
            }
          ],
          "conditionLogic": "AND"
        },
        {
          "text": {
            "en": "What does the <color=orange>festival</color> refer to?",
            "zh": "您提到的<color=orange>大会</color>是指？",
            "ja": ""
          },
          "targetIndex": 13,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
              "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
              "variableName": "infoPassA_2",
              "comparison": "Equal",
              "compareValue": "False"
            }
          ],
          "conditionLogic": "AND"
        },
        {
          "text": {
            "en": "Thank you for telling me all this.",
            "zh": "非常感谢您告诉我这些事。（结束对话）",
            "ja": ""
          },
          "targetIndex": 14,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
