    {
      "index": 2,
      "name": {
        "en": "The Boy",
        "zh": "小男孩",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/小男孩",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Dad! Look! I can bend its arm all the way back! So cool!",
        "zh": "爸爸！你看这个可以从后面弯过去，好厉害啊！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_惊醒",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(That’s exactly what he said in the dream… and that<color=orange> puppet</color> in his hand... eerily reminds me of what he turned into.)",
        "zh": "（和之前梦里一模一样的对话，还有男孩手里的<color=orange>木偶</color>......让我想起了他之前变成的那个样子。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(No point in overthinking. Let’s try talking to them.)",
        "zh": "（胡思乱想也没有用，试着搭一下话吧。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "I’ve never seen a puppet like that before. May I ask where you got it from?",
        "zh": "我从来没有见过这种样式的木偶呢？请问你们是在哪里买到的呢？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "name": {
        "en": "The Boy",
        "zh": "小男孩",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/小男孩",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Someone gave it to me as a present! I brought it with me before we left for the trip!",
        "zh": "这是别人送给我的！出去玩之前我就带在身上了！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "name": {
        "en": "Dad",
        "zh": "男孩父亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5818",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Make sure you keep it safe this time. Don’t leave it at the hotel again.",
        "zh": "喜欢的话就要收好哦，不要像之前一样忘在酒店里了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Sigh… I really didn’t want him to accept that puppet. Those <color=orange>people in cloaks</color> were very off.",
        "zh": "唉，我其实不希望他收下那个木偶的，那些<color=orange>穿着斗篷的人</color>实在太奇怪了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_疑惑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "People in cloaks?",
        "zh": "穿着斗篷的人？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "I refused, but he just kept begging for it, and now he won’t go anywhere without it.",
        "zh": "我实在拗不过这孩子才同意让他收下的，没想到他喜欢到出来旅行都要带着。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "About this \"<color=orange>Troupe Elysium</color>.\" Would you mind sharing what you know about them?",
        "zh": "关于这个“<color=orange>极乐戏团</color>”，您方便告诉我一些关于他们的事吗？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 17,
      "eventCalls": [
        {
          "targetObjectID": "c53927c3-c77c-4e2f-8953-f20a86ed29da",
          "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
          "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
