    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Sorry to bother you, but may I ask what<color=orange> festival</color> you were talking about earlier?",
        "zh": "不好意思，请问您之前提到的<color=orange>大会</color>是指什么呢？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 24,
      "eventCalls": [
        {
          "targetObjectID": "c53927c3-c77c-4e2f-8953-f20a86ed29da",
          "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
          "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
          "methodName": "SetInfoPass2True",
          "parameterType": "None",
          "stringParameter": "",
          "intParameter": 0,
          "floatParameter": 0,
          "boolParameter": false,
          "triggerTiming": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Don’t worry about it, sweetie. You’re not from Yuntai, are you?",
        "zh": "别客气，小姑娘你不是芸台本地人吧？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 34,
      "eventCalls": [
        {
          "targetObjectID": "c53927c3-c77c-4e2f-8953-f20a86ed29da",
          "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
          "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
          "methodName": "SetInfoPass3True",
          "parameterType": "None",
          "stringParameter": "",
          "intParameter": 0,
          "floatParameter": 0,
          "boolParameter": false,
          "triggerTiming": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Oh dear, kids your age really do love mysterious groups like that, huh?",
        "zh": "哎呀，你们这个年纪的孩子果然会对这种神秘团体感兴趣呢~",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Haha~ I used to be into that kind of thing back in college too. I even joined a local folklore club. Ended up meeting my husband thanks to that. Kinda romantic, right?",
        "zh": "呵呵呵~阿姨我大学的时候也很喜欢研究这种事，还加入了研究本地民俗的社团，拜此所赐遇见了这孩子的父亲，很青春吧？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "name": {
        "en": "Dad",
        "zh": "男孩父亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5818",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "...... (blushing)",
        "zh": "......（脸红）。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "name": {
        "en": "The Boy",
        "zh": "小男孩",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/小男孩",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Hahaha! Dad's embarrassed again!",
        "zh": "哈哈哈哈爸爸又不好意思了！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(What a lively family.)",
        "zh": "（真是个有活力的家庭啊。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "But honestly, I don’t know that much about the troupe itself.",
        "zh": "不过我确实不是很了解这个戏团的事。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "They looked very suspicious. If their flyers hadn’t said they were performing at this year’s <color=orange>Qiqiao Festival</color>, I’d honestly have thought they were some weird cult sneaking into the city.",
        "zh": "那些人看起来实在太可疑了，要不是他们的宣传单写着要在今年<color=orange>乞巧大会</color>上表演，我都担心是有什么奇怪的异教团体混进了芸台。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "You don’t know? It’s the <color=orange>Qiqiao Festival</color> held in Yuntai every two years! It’s one of our city’s biggest celebrations.",
        "zh": "你不知道吗？芸台每两年一届的<color=orange>乞巧大会</color>啊！那可是芸台特有的，城市级别的盛会。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "name": {
        "en": "The Boy",
        "zh": "小男孩",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/小男孩",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "It’s super fun! We’re getting back just in time. The opening ceremony is tomorrow!",
        "zh": "真的特别好玩！我们今天回去，正好能赶上明天大会正式开幕呢！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Right, I think this flight’s supposed to land around 8 p.m. Still about an hour to go.",
        "zh": "嗯，我们这班飞机好像预计是晚上八点落地吧，还有一个多小时。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_疑惑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(<color=orange>Qiqiao</color>… I think I’ve heard of it. Isn’t it an astrology-related festival? We don’t celebrate it where I’m from.)",
        "zh": "（<color=orange>乞巧</color>？我记得好像是和星象相关的节日？我们那里没有过这个节的习惯。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "I think I’ve heard of <color=orange>Qiqiao</color> before. Is there a tradition of star worship here in Yuntai?",
        "zh": "<color=orange>乞巧节</color>我似乎有印象，芸台是有拜双星的传统吗？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "name": {
        "en": "The Boy",
        "zh": "小男孩",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/小男孩",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Star worship?",
        "zh": "双星？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Oh, that part’s not really practiced anymore! But there are still a lot of people who worship <color=orange>Xi Mu</color>.",
        "zh": "啊，芸台现在的乞巧大会已经没有拜星环节啦~不过拜<color=orange>喜母</color>的人似乎还是有很多的。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "name": {
        "en": "Dad",
        "zh": "男孩父亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5818",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Most of the outside groups that compete in the festival don’t cause any trouble, historically speaking.",
        "zh": "不过历年来参与斗巧的外地团体其实很少，一般不会起什么事端。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_疑惑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(<color=orange>Xi Mu? Craft duels?</color> I want to ask more, but I’ve already kept them long enough. Better leave it here for now.)",
        "zh": "（<color=orange>喜母？斗巧？</color>虽然很想再了解一些内容，但已经打扰他们太久了，就先到这里吧。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
