    {
      "index": 40,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Yeah, maybe starting about half a month ago, there were folks showing up in Yuntai calling themselves the \"Troupe Elysium.\"",
        "zh": "从大概半个月前开始吧，芸台市里开始出现一些自称为“极乐戏团”成员的人",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "They said they were performing at this year’s festival, and started promoting themselves all over the city.",
        "zh": "他们好像是要参与今年的大会进行表演吧，一直在市区各种地方进行宣传。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "One day after school, we ran into them handing out free merch on the street. He really liked one of the puppets.",
        "zh": "我带这孩子放学回家的时候，正好碰上他们在路边发放免费的周边，这孩子特别喜欢其中的木偶。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "I’ve seen them around, handing out merch and giving talks on the street, but all the members I’ve come across were <color=orange>wearing masks and those long robes with hoods</color>.",
        "zh": "虽然经常能见到他们的成员在路边发放周边和进行宣讲活动，但是我见过的所有成员都<color=orange>带着面具，穿着带有兜帽的长袍</color>。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": -1
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "There are all sorts of fun events and tons of traditional performances.",
        "zh": "大会上有各种各样有趣的活动，还会有很多本地特色的表演节目哦！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "The festival still keeps the old \"<color=orange>craft competitions</color>,\" which is probably how strange groups like <color=orange>Troupe Elysium</color> get a chance to perform.",
        "zh": "大会也保留着<color=orange>斗巧</color>的传统，这也是为什么像<color=orange>极乐戏团</color>这种不知来路的奇怪团体也能参与大会进行表演。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Just so you know, Yuntai always goes into lockdown for the three days of the festival. Did your friend mention that to you?",
        "zh": "不过每次大会即将召开之际，芸台都会暂时<color=orange>封城</color>直到三日后大会结束，这点你的朋友有告诉过你吗？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "name": {
        "en": "Mom",
        "zh": "男孩母亲",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/IMG_5819",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "There’s been some unrest during past festivals, and things have felt especially tense these past few years. Please be careful.",
        "zh": "往届乞巧大会期间，市内偶尔有些骚动，近几年局势似乎有些紧张，一定要注意安全哦。",
        "ja": ""
      },
